# Export settings from Microtik cAP
## Configure connection
### Set static IP to PC
`sudo ip addr add 192.168.1.222/24 dev enp0s25`
### Find Microtik MAC address
`sudo mndp -i enp0s25`
### Connect via MAC
`sudo mactelnet b8:69:f4:00:4a:76 enp0s25`
### Set root static IP for Microtik
`/ip address add address=13.13.0.1/24 interface=bridge-lan`
### Set static IP for PC in same network
`sudo ip addr add 13.13.0.2/24 dev enp0s25`
## Export config file
### Check SSH connection
`ssh admin@13.13.0.1`
### Create config file
`/export file=pseudobridge_config`
### Copy config via SCP
`scp admin@13.13.0.1:/pseudobridge_config.rsc /home/sandrat/DevOps-Test-Lab/`
